1128	tropical depression	5
a hurricane usually start as a organize thunderstorm activity that stretch at least 100 mile across and maintain its identity for more than 24 hour . under the right condition it can develop further and start to spin around a low-pressure center . if it develop it be classify as a `` tropical cyclone '' or `` tropical depression '' . if the system strengthen and wind speed rise past 39 mph , the system be dub a `` tropical storm '' . if the pressure in the center drop even further and the wind really pick up and form a clearly define `` eye '' it be a hurricane .
