the flu virus have receptor , which be like viral velcro , on the surface of the virus particle . the receptor will lock onto a target cell use these chemical receptor on the surface , which dock onto the cell surface . the receptor then go into the cell . the receptor use it like a factory . the receptor take it over and make it produce thousand or in some case million of copy of new virus . the copy come streaming out of the cell . the copy infect other cell to make more virus , or they escape from the body and infect a new victim .
