a radioisotope have unstable nucleus that do not have enough binding energy to hold the nucleus together . radioisotope would like to be stable isotope so they be constantly change to try and stabilize . in the process , they will release energy and matter from they nucleus and often transform into a new element . this process , call transmutation , be the change of one element into another as a result of change within the nucleus . he radioactive decay and transmutation process will continue until a new element be form that have a stable nucleus and be not radioactive .
