1150	photovoltaic cell	9
a photovoltaic cell be create with two layer of semiconductor material . the top layer be `` dope '' with impurity to allow a negative charge . the bottom layer be `` dope '' to allow for a positive charge . this produce a electric field that allow electron to flow from negative to positve . sunlight enter the cell . energy from sunlight knock electron loose in both field . this prevent the flow of electron from negative to positive . add a external circuit allow the exchange to continue . give the cell owner a flow of electricity .
