solar panel actually comprise many , smaller unit call photovoltaic cell . photovoltaic simply mean they convert sunlight into electricity . -rrb- . many cell link together make up a solar panel . each photovoltaic cell be basically a sandwich make up of two slice of semi-conducting material , usually silicon : . manufacturer `` dope '' silicon with other material , give each slice of the sandwich a positive or negative electrical charge . this add extra electron , with a negative charge , to that layer . meanwhile , the bottom layer get a dose of boron , which result in fewer electron , or a positive charge . this all add up to a electric field at the junction between the silicon layer . when a photon of sunlight knock a electron free , the electric field will push that electron out of the silicon junction . a couple of other component of the cell turn these electron into usable power .
