a type of coal must be choose before the heating can start . the coal be break down to a smaller material . the coal particle mix with hot air and move in to a boiler . water in the boiler be pump and produce steam with the coal . steam power turbine blade , which magnetically charge wire coal . the water return back in to its chamber and the process be repeat .
