a machine call a pulverizer grind the coal into a fine powder . the coal powder mix with hot air , which help the coal burn more efficiently , and the mixture move to the furnace . the burning coal heat water in a boiler , create steam . steam release from the boiler power a engine call a turbine , transform heat energy from burn coal into mechanical energy that spin the turbine engine . the spin turbine be use to power a generator , a machine that turn mechanical energy into electric energy . this happen when magnet inside a copper coil in the generator spin . a condenser cool the steam move through the turbine . as the steam be condensed , it turn back into water . the water return to the boiler , and the cycle begin again .
