dead organic material accumulate on the bottom of ocean , riverbed or swamp , mix with mud and sand . over time , more sediment pile on top . the result heat and pressure transform the organic layer into a dark and waxy substance know as kerogen . leave alone , the kerogen molecule eventually crack . the molecule break up into shorter and lighter molecule compose almost solely of carbon and hydrogen atom . it will turn into either petroleum or natural gas .
