something make a sound and make sound wave . sound wave be `` collect '' by the the outer ear . sound wave travel through the middle ear . sound wave hit the eardrum . vibration from the eardrum cause very small bone in the inner ear to move . the small bone in the inner ear give information about sound to the cochlea . the cochlea help turn the sound vibration into nerve signal . the brain can take these nerve signal and can register a sound to you because of they .
