the butterfly start as a egg . the egg hatch to form a larva , also call a caterpillar . the carterpillar molt -lrb- lose its skin -rrb- many time as it grow . the caterpillar then form itself into a pupa , or chrysalis . the caterpillar in the chrysalis begin change , a process call mmetaphorphosis . the caterpillar complete its metamorphosis and have turn into a butterfly . the adult butterfly emerge out of the chrysalis and fly away ! .
