the organism must die to begin the process . the soft tissue decompose . the bone be leave behind . scavenger tear the body apart and move the bone elsewhere . wind and rain also scatter the bone further . the bone leave behind will weather and become bury by sand and soil . the protein in the bone be replace with mineral that be dissolve in the soil . this create a rock-like substance call a fossil . water and wind erosion wear away the layer of soil on top of the fossil . this make discovery of the fossil possible .
