water from ocean , lake , swamp , river , and plant turn into water vapor . water vapor condense into million of tiny droplet that form cloud . cloud lose these droplet through rain or snow , also cause precipitation . precipitation be either absorb into the ground or run off into river . water that be absorb into the ground be take up by plant . plant lose water from they surface as vapor . the vapor go back into the atmosphere . water that run off into river flow into pond , lake , or ocean . the water evaporate back into the atmosphere .
