limestone be locate under the soil . rain pick up carbon dioxide as it fall to earth . the rain fall on the soil over the limestone . the carbon dioxide in the rain wash through the soil . the carbon dioxide turn into acid . the acid in the rain get to the limestone below the soil . the acid dissolve the limestone . acid continue to erode the limestone with more rain over time . the erode limestone sometimes form cave .
