the coal be pulverize to a very fine powder . the coal powder be mix with hot air and blow into the firebox of the boiler . water pump through pipe inside the boiler be turn into steam by the heat . the pressure of the steam push against a series of giant blade turn the turbine shaft . turbine shaft be connect to the shaft of the generator . the magnet inside the generator spin within wire coil to produce electricity .
